            "review_title": "Review at La Renna",
            "review_text": "2TravelLuvers\nSioux Falls, South Dakota1135 contributions\n0\nExcellent meal\nDec 2025 • Couples\nWe decided to take a chance on this place because of its proximity to our accommodation. We were thrilled we did. The bread they started us with was great. I had the spaghetti with meat sauce. My wife had the cannelloni di Romagna. I also had the lemon sorbetto for dessert. Everything was phenomenal. Looking forward to a return visit.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 31, 2025",
